W-05 review round 1: Request changes. Fix these 3 Must-fix items, then re-run `cd app && npm test && npm run lint && npm run typecheck` and report again (files changed, what fixed, checks).

1. [Spec, high] context.ts:59-66 — saveStoredParams copies params.utm into nl_flow_context with no consent check, so UTMs reach sessionStorage before consent (violates 07 storage table, Q5, Q53, your Q61). Fix: never store utm in nl_flow_context; nl_utm via persistUtm is the only stored UTM copy. saveStoredParams writes only plan, market, locale, orderId.

2. [Bug, high] context.ts:69-74 — stored orderId:null (saved on Plans/StartingEid) beats ?orderId=ord_1 on /payment/return, so PaymentReturn goes "None → Plans" after real payment. 04 PaymentReturn: "orderId from stored context, else from the URL". Fix: orderId = stored?.orderId ?? query?.orderId ?? null.

3. [Bug, high] context.ts:73 — query UTMs lost whenever any context is stored. 07: read UTMs from query only when no stored UTMs. resolveUtm exists but is unused. Fix: utm = resolveUtm(loadUtm(storage), query?.utm ?? {}).

Reviewer's suggested shape:
```ts
export function resolveFlowParams(storage, search) {
  const stored = loadStoredParams(storage); // no utm
  const query = parseFlowParams(search);
  const base = stored ?? query;
  if (!base) return null;
  return { ...base, orderId: stored?.orderId ?? query?.orderId ?? null, utm: resolveUtm(loadUtm(storage), query?.utm ?? {}) };
}
```
Also: update Q61 (whole-object trust for plan/market/locale, per-field fallback for orderId, UTMs resolved separately) and add regression tests in context.test.ts for: (P1) persist without consent → nothing UTM-ish in sessionStorage; (P2) stored orderId null + ?orderId=ord_1 → ord_1; (P3) stored context, no nl_utm, query utm_source=news → utm_source=news.

Optional (cheap, do if trivial): add resolveUtm test in utm.test.ts; move Q61 to "P1: flow correctness" section; extract toSearchParams(params) instead of buildReturnUrl('http://x',…) trick. Skip the rest.

